sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor Client as User / API client
participant API as API service
participant Controller as StationTemperatureReportsController
participant ReportService as GetCurrentTemperatureReportService
participant StationRepository as IStationRepository / MongoWeatherStationRepository
participant IngestionClient as ApiToIngestionCurrentWeatherClient
participant Ingestion as Ingestion service
participant WeatherController as CurrentWeatherController
participant Provider as ResilientWeatherDataProvider
participant OWM as OpenWeatherMapAdapter / OpenWeather API

Client->>API: GET /stations/:stationId/reports/temperature/current
API->>Controller: route with JWT user
Controller->>ReportService: execute({ stationId })
ReportService->>StationRepository: findById(stationId)
StationRepository-->>ReportService: station

alt station.provider is not openweather
  ReportService--xController: UnsupportedCurrentTemperatureProviderError
  Controller-->>Client: 422 Unprocessable Entity
else station.provider is openweather
  ReportService->>IngestionClient: getCurrentWeather({ latitude, longitude })
  IngestionClient->>Ingestion: GET /internal/weather/current?latitude&longitude<br/>x-ingestion-token
  Ingestion->>WeatherController: route with ManualIngestionTokenGuard
  WeatherController->>Provider: getCurrentWeather(location)
  alt Provider success
    Provider->>OWM: fetch current weather (timeout, breaker, bulkhead applied)
    OWM-->>Provider: normalized reading
    Provider-->>WeatherController: reading
    WeatherController-->>Ingestion: 200 CurrentWeatherReadingResponse
    Ingestion-->>IngestionClient: reading
    IngestionClient-->>ReportService: reading
    ReportService-->>Controller: CurrentTemperatureReportResponse
    Controller-->>Client: 200 CurrentTemperatureReportDto
  else Provider failure (timeout, breaker open, bulkhead rejected or invalid payload)
    Provider--xWeatherController: typed WeatherDataProviderError
    WeatherController-->>Ingestion: 502/503/504 mapped error
    Ingestion-->>IngestionClient: HTTP error response
    IngestionClient--xReportService: ApiToIngestionBoundaryError
    ReportService--xController: propagate typed error
    Controller-->>Client: 502/503/504 mapped error, no stack trace exposed
  end
end

Note over Provider,OWM: Synchronous reads never use the scheduled-cycle cache<br/>a failure always returns a typed error, never stale data
Note over API,Ingestion: The reading is never persisted to MongoDB from this flow
